#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:9
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "概览导引"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:11
msgid ""
"**Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin (KPP)** is a PyTorch plugin designed for training "
"and evaluating quantum-native energy models and enhanced AI models on "
"**Special Purpose Quantum Computers (SPQC)**."
msgstr ""
"**Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin（KPP）** 是一个 PyTorch "
"插件，旨在**专用量子计算机（SPQC）**上训练和评估量子原生能量模型及增强型 AI 模型。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:13
msgid ""
"It offloads Boltzmann sampling to the **Coherent Ising Machine (CIM)** "
"through the **Kaiwu SDK**, while keeping all other computations, "
"parameter updates, autograd, data loading, in the standard **PyTorch** "
"workflow."
msgstr ""
"它通过 **Kaiwu SDK** 将玻尔兹曼采样卸载到**相干伊辛机（CIM）**，同时将所有其他计算、参数更新、自动微分、数据加载保留在标准 "
"**PyTorch** 工作流中。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:15
msgid "General Overview"
msgstr "总体概览"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:16
msgid "Design Goals"
msgstr "设计目标"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:18
msgid ""
"**Integrate quantum sampling capabilities** while preserving the native "
"PyTorch programming experience."
msgstr "**集成量子采样能力**，同时保留原生 PyTorch 编程体验。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:19
msgid "**Support definition, training, and inference** of standard BM/RBM models"
msgstr "**支持标准 BM/RBM 模型的定义、训练与推理**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:20
msgid "**Extensible interfaces** for swapping samplers or energy functions"
msgstr "**可扩展接口**，便于替换采样器或能量函数"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:21
msgid ""
"**Decoupled architecture**: energy model definition is **separated** from"
" sampling execution"
msgstr "**解耦架构**：能量模型定义与采样执行**分离**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:23
msgid "Features"
msgstr "功能特性"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:28
msgid "Feature"
msgstr "特性"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:29
#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:229
msgid "Description"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:30
msgid "**Model Support**"
msgstr "**模型支持**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:31
msgid "Standard RBM and fully connected BM"
msgstr "标准 RBM 和全连接 BM"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:32
msgid "**Layer Configuration**"
msgstr "**层配置**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:33
msgid "Customizable visible and hidden layer dimensions"
msgstr "可见层与隐藏层维度可自定义"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:34
msgid "**Sampling**"
msgstr "**采样**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:35
msgid "Negative-phase sampling executed on SPQC via Kaiwu SDK"
msgstr "负相采样通过 Kaiwu SDK 在 SPQC 上执行"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:36
msgid "**PyTorch Integration**"
msgstr "**PyTorch 集成**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:37
msgid ""
"Model parameters are `torch.nn.Parameter`; supports autograd, GPU "
"acceleration, and combination with other PyTorch modules"
msgstr "模型参数为 `torch.nn.Parameter`；支持自动微分、GPU 加速，并可与其他 PyTorch 模块组合使用"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:38
msgid "**Extended Models**"
msgstr "**扩展模型**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:39
msgid "DBN, Q-VAE, Q-Diffusion"
msgstr "DBN、Q-VAE、Q-Diffusion"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:41
msgid "Extension Mechanisms"
msgstr "扩展机制"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:43
msgid "Decouple the energy function (e.g., Ising form) from the sampler."
msgstr "将能量函数（如伊辛形式）与采样器解耦。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:44
msgid ""
"Allow users to replace sampling strategies by implementing standard "
"interfaces (e.g., switching to classical MCMC or other backends)."
msgstr "允许用户通过实现标准接口替换采样策略（例如切换为经典 MCMC 或其他后端）。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:45
msgid "Support custom energy terms suitable for non-standard BM variants."
msgstr "支持适用于非标准 BM 变体的自定义能量项。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:47
msgid "System Architecture & Component Interaction"
msgstr "系统架构与组件交互"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:49
msgid ""
"KPP follows a **decoupled architecture** where energy model definition is"
" separated from sampling execution (hardware or simulation). Researchers "
"can treat quantum samplers as **pluggable backends** within standard "
"PyTorch workflows."
msgstr ""
"KPP 采用**解耦架构**，能量模型定义与采样执行（硬件或模拟）分离。研究人员可以在标准 PyTorch "
"工作流中将量子采样器视为**可插拔后端**。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:97
msgid "**Layer Breakdown:**"
msgstr "**层级分解：**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:101
msgid "Layer"
msgstr "层级"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:102
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "内容"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:103
msgid "**Application Layer**"
msgstr "**应用层**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:104
msgid ""
"`rbm_digits`, `dbn_digits`, `bm_generation`, `qvae_mnist`, `qvae_cell`, "
"`qdiffusion`"
msgstr ""
"`rbm_digits`, `dbn_digits`, `bm_generation`, `qvae_mnist`, `qvae_cell`, "
"`qdiffusion`"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:105
msgid "**KPP Layer**"
msgstr "**KPP 层**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:106
msgid ""
"`AbstractBoltzmannMachine`, `RestrictedBoltzmannMachine`, "
"`BoltzmannMachine`, `DBN`, `GBRBM`, `QVAE`, `QDiffusion`; "
"`_to_ising_matrix()`, `sample()`, `objective()`"
msgstr ""
"`AbstractBoltzmannMachine`, `RestrictedBoltzmannMachine`, "
"`BoltzmannMachine`, `DBN`, `GBRBM`, `QVAE`, `QDiffusion`; "
"`_to_ising_matrix()`, `sample()`, `objective()`"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:107
msgid "**Kaiwu SDK Layer**"
msgstr "**Kaiwu SDK 层**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:108
msgid "Classical (SA) & Quantum (CIM) optimizers"
msgstr "经典（SA）与量子（CIM）优化器"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:111
msgid "Core Concept 1: Quantum-Classical Hybrid Workflow"
msgstr "核心概念 1：量子-经典混合工作流"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:113
msgid ""
"KPP follows the standard energy-based model training loop, with a "
"quantum-accelerated negative phase."
msgstr "KPP 遵循标准的基于能量的模型训练循环，其中负相由量子加速。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:115
msgid "Three-Step Training Cycle:"
msgstr "三步训练循环："

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:117
msgid "**Positive Phase (PyTorch, CPU/GPU):**"
msgstr "**正相（PyTorch，CPU/GPU）：**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:118
msgid "Compute hidden layer representations from training data."
msgstr "从训练数据计算隐藏层表示。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:119
msgid "`h = rbm.get_hidden(x)` → data statistics, no sampling needed."
msgstr "`h = rbm.get_hidden(x)` → 数据统计量，无需采样。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:121
msgid "**Negative Phase (Offloaded to SDK):**"
msgstr "**负相（卸载到 SDK）：**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:122
msgid "Generate samples from the model distribution."
msgstr "从模型分布生成样本。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:123
msgid "`s = rbm.sample(sampler)`."
msgstr "`s = rbm.sample(sampler)`。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:124
msgid ""
"Internally, `_to_ising_matrix()` prepares the J/h matrix and dispatches "
"it to a **CIM** (quantum) or **SA** (classical) solver."
msgstr "内部由 `_to_ising_matrix()` 准备 J/h 矩阵，并将其分发给 **CIM**（量子）或 **SA**（经典）求解器。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:126
msgid "**Parameter Update (PyTorch, CPU/GPU):**"
msgstr "**参数更新（PyTorch，CPU/GPU）：**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:127
msgid "`objective = rbm.objective(h, s)`."
msgstr "`objective = rbm.objective(h, s)`。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:128
msgid "`objective.backward()`."
msgstr "`objective.backward()`。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:129
msgid "`optimizer.step()`."
msgstr "`optimizer.step()`。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:185
msgid ""
"**Key Insight:** The only quantum part is `rbm.sample(sampler)`. "
"Everything else is standard PyTorch."
msgstr "**关键洞察：** 唯一的量子部分是 `rbm.sample(sampler)`。其余都是标准 PyTorch。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:187
msgid "Core Concept 2: Energy Model Hierarchy"
msgstr "核心概念 2：能量模型层级"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:189
msgid ""
"KPP provides a structured class hierarchy. All models share "
"`sample(sampler)` and `objective(h, s)` interfaces."
msgstr "KPP 提供结构化的类层级。所有模型共享 `sample(sampler)` 和 `objective(h, s)` 接口。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:223
msgid "**Model Descriptions:**"
msgstr "**模型说明：**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:228
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:230
msgid "**RBM**"
msgstr "**RBM**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:231
msgid "Bipartite graph, layer-wise connections only"
msgstr "二部图，仅层间连接"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:232
msgid "**BM**"
msgstr "**BM**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:233
msgid "Fully connected stochastic network; uses `condition_sample()`"
msgstr "全连接随机网络；使用 `condition_sample()`"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:234
msgid "**QVAE**"
msgstr "**QVAE**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:235
msgid "BM as prior in a VAE"
msgstr "BM 作为 VAE 中的先验"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:236
msgid "**QDiffusion**"
msgstr "**QDiffusion**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:237
msgid "Energy-guided sampling for discrete sequence generation"
msgstr "用于离散序列生成的能量引导采样"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:240
msgid "Core Concept 3: Hardware Abstraction & Extension"
msgstr "核心概念 3：硬件抽象与扩展"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:242
msgid ""
"**Hardware abstraction:** KPP communicates with quantum hardware via "
"Kaiwu SDK; swap samplers (SA/CIM) without code changes."
msgstr "**硬件抽象：** KPP 通过 Kaiwu SDK 与量子硬件通信；无需修改代码即可切换采样器（SA/CIM）。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:243
msgid "**Sampler interface:**"
msgstr "**采样器接口：**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:260
msgid ""
"**Extension mechanisms:** Decoupled energy function, swappable samplers, "
"custom energy terms."
msgstr "**扩展机制：** 解耦的能量函数、可切换采样器、自定义能量项。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:262
msgid "Applications & Workflow"
msgstr "应用与工作流"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:263
msgid "Example Use Cases"
msgstr "示例用例"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:265
msgid ""
"**RNA sequence data augmentation (BM):** Generative modeling with fully "
"connected Boltzmann Machines for biological sequence augmentation."
msgstr "**RNA 序列数据增强（BM）：** 使用全连接玻尔兹曼机进行生物序列增强的生成建模。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:266
msgid ""
"**Handwritten digit classification (RBM / DBN):** Train Restricted "
"Boltzmann Machines and Deep Belief Networks on the MNIST dataset for "
"feature learning and classification."
msgstr "**手写数字分类（RBM / DBN）：** 在 MNIST 数据集上训练受限玻尔兹曼机和深度信念网络，用于特征学习与分类。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:267
msgid ""
"**Q-VAE training pipeline:** Use a Boltzmann Machine as a learnable prior"
" within a variational autoencoder."
msgstr "**Q-VAE 训练流程：** 在变分自编码器中使用玻尔兹曼机作为可学习先验。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:268
msgid "**Q-Diffusion:** Energy-guided sampling for discrete sequence generation."
msgstr "**Q-Diffusion：** 用于离散序列生成的能量引导采样。"

