msgstr "**研究人员**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:278
msgid "Validate the impact of quantum sampling on energy-based model training"
msgstr "验证量子采样对基于能量的模型训练的影响"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:279
msgid "**Developers**"
msgstr "**开发者**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:280
msgid "Build hybrid classical-quantum generative models"
msgstr "构建混合经典-量子生成模型"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:281
msgid "**Educators & Students**"
msgstr "**教育者与学生**"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:282
msgid "Teach Boltzmann machine principles and quantum sampling practice"
msgstr "教授玻尔兹曼机原理与量子采样实践"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:285
msgid "Typical Usage Workflow"
msgstr "典型使用流程"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:287
msgid ""
"The typical workflow for training energy-based models using the Kaiwu-"
"PyTorch-Plugin is as follows:"
msgstr "使用 Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin 训练基于能量的模型的典型流程如下："

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:289
msgid ""
"<b>Data Preparation</b>: Load and preprocess the training data, "
"converting it into the model input format"
msgstr "<b>数据准备</b>：加载并预处理训练数据，转换为模型输入格式"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:290
msgid ""
"<b>Model Definition</b>: Instantiate an RBM or BM model, setting the "
"dimensions of the visible and hidden layers."
msgstr "<b>模型定义</b>：实例化 RBM 或 BM 模型，设置可见层和隐藏层的维度。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:291
msgid ""
"<b>Optimizer Configuration</b>: Use PyTorch optimizers (such as SGD, "
"Adam) to manage model parameters"
msgstr "<b>优化器配置</b>：使用 PyTorch 优化器（如 SGD、Adam）管理模型参数"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:292
msgid "<b>Training Loop</b>:"
msgstr "<b>训练循环</b>："

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:293
msgid ""
"Compute hidden layer representations from the training data (positive "
"phase)."
msgstr "从训练数据计算隐藏层表示（正相）。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:294
msgid ""
"Use a sampler to generate samples from the model distribution (negative "
"phase)."
msgstr "使用采样器从模型分布生成样本（负相）。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:295
msgid "Calculate the loss function and backpropagate the gradients."
msgstr "计算损失函数并反向传播梯度。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:296
msgid "Update model parameters"
msgstr "更新模型参数"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:298
msgid ""
"<b>Model Evaluation</b>: Use the trained model to perform feature "
"extraction, classification, or generation tasks"
msgstr "<b>模型评估</b>：使用训练好的模型进行特征提取、分类或生成任务"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/introduction.md:333
